# FinTrack imports

- `imported_transactions` is staging only: rows do not affect ledgers until the user resolves them (expense, credit, investment, ignore).
- Every imported row must have a stable `upstream_txn_id` or deterministic dedup signature; batches are undoable.
- Do not assume Setu API field shapes from memory—use official docs and typed adapters in `lib/integrations/setu/`.
- Classification and confidence scores live on staging rows; resolution writes ledger entries and links back to staging.
